      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "证据锚点：A2A official_v1_core_jsonrpc；JSON-RPC methods = SendMessage / GetTask / CancelTask；关键审计 action = auth_check / security_check；Artifact metadata = delivery.protocol / semantic_mismatch_findings；专项 Agent 输出写入 details.decision_agents。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "证据锚点：A2A official_v1_core_jsonrpc；JSON-RPC methods = SendMessage / GetTask / CancelTask；关键审计 action = auth_check / security_check；Artifact metadata = delivery.protocol / semantic_mismatch_findings；专项 Agent 输出写入 details.decision_agents。",
